# ===========================================
# CLAUDE NOTES - READ THIS FILE FIRST
# ===========================================
# Project: NanoArcade Manager
# GitHub: https://github.com/audioslayer/NanoArcade
#
# Push with your normal GitHub login (gh auth / Git Credential Manager).
# Do not store tokens in this folder.
#
# TO RELEASE A NEW VERSION:
# 1. Commit all changes to git
# 2. Push to GitHub
# 3. Create a new git tag (e.g., v1.1, v1.2, v2.0)
# 4. Create zip file of the project
# 5. Create GitHub release with the zip attached
# 6. Include release notes describing what changed
#
# CURRENT VERSION: v1.2 (working toward v1.3)
# ===========================================

